{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-15_end","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-15","title":"回答我","storyCode":"11-17","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"a2b1ec13c24920d4779212e54092bad0efdf97f350d8520092bfd567d7404f26","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！我們得帶著阿米婭立刻離開這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是特雷西斯......閃靈一個人也拖不住他多久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住滑索，博士，我們能走多遠是多遠！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在不行的話，我會衝上去跟他們拼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不想打架的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......特蕾西婭把我從閣樓里拉了出來。阿米婭和凱爾希讓我知道了這份工作的責任有多重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好歹......我也是血魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了你們的話，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾小姐，看這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該跑了，博士——我綁好滑索了，把手給我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g6_controltower_street"},{"type":"narration","text":"長劍刺向地面，輝光瞬間漫開。\n所有人都感到了時間的刹那停滯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"......赦罪師的巫術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希勳爵她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"她這一次的生命正走向尾聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的卡特斯也被救走了。血魔大君正在追擊女妖和阿斯卡綸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭那邊的情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，我剛剛收到殿下的信號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它已經準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"攝政王抬頭看向陰雲遮蔽下的天空和遠處的高牆。\n高牆之外，才是薩卡茲真正關注的戰場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，該開始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g9_kingrest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼好準備的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們終於走到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，我必須——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須，見證這一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g10_kingrestcore"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的建築在地下空間的盡頭沉默著，精巧複雜的結構排布其中。\n維多利亞一代又一代最傑出的頭腦曾聚集在這裡，他們傾盡心血構造了這一切。\n卻只為了將那把劍安放其中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g10_kingrestcore"},{"type":"narration","text":"能握住它劈開天災的英雄實在罕有，那麼就以人類的智慧張開這面抵禦風暴的盾牌。\n這些結構，乃至這座建築，都是因此而生。\n聲音又出現了。\n那些呼喚不再急切，不再尖銳，也沒有了規勸或煽動的意涵。\n取而代之的，她感受到某種帶著疲憊的安寧。\n是的，她來過這裡，早在記憶成形之前，就有人指引她來到過這個地方。\n就和當時一樣，在這一刻，她知道自己該去往何處，該拿起什麼。\n它就在那裡，筆直地插在房間中央，無人拱衛，無物保護，普通得就像整座建築中的一件小小裝飾品。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i10"},{"type":"narration","text":"諸王之息。\n經過千年歲月，多次重鑄，它始終在那裡。\n推進之王向它伸出手。\n破碎的幻影彌漫在整個空間中，他們在起伏，他們在共振。\n亞歷山德莉娜。亞歷山德莉娜·維娜·維多利亞。他們在她耳旁反覆呢喃她的名字與姓氏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i10"},{"type":"narration","text":"她觸碰到了那把劍。\n往日的碎片徑直從她的身體裡穿過，轟鳴聲從她的大腦深處炸開。\n她忽然明白了。\n那些畫面，那些聲音的源頭正是她自己。\n是她自己的猶豫、困惑、悔恨、追戀。\n是她已經忘卻的和故意忘卻的東西。\n一隻巨手將她舉起，倫蒂尼姆在她身下站了起來，托著她行走過維多利亞的土地。\n那是她和她的夥伴們曾經行過的土地。\n無數個聲音交疊在一起。\n維多利亞。維多利亞。\n這就是維多利亞。\n這就是她的維多利亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"耳畔傳來一連串呼喊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g10_kingrestcore"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"推進之王睜開眼睛，再沒有幻覺，再沒有浪潮，而象徵著維多利亞王權的諸王之息正握在她手裡。\n它看起來並沒有傳說中的那麼特別，並不巨大，也沒有什麼誇張的裝飾。\n似乎就只是一把普通的劍而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你握住了諸王之息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它比我想像的......要輕一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們該回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"推進之王想轉過身，和朋友們一同感受這把劍的溫度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別回頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一把更為冰冷的刀卻抵在了她的腰間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別回頭！求你了，別回頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......把這把劍交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山德莉娜殿下，我很抱歉，我真的......非常非常抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿勒黛的聲音平靜如水，卻凝結著恢宏決絕的悲哀。\n推進之王突然想起了摩根玩笑似的寫的那本“回憶錄”，還只有寥寥幾頁。\n句子結構簡陋，用詞也算不上典雅。\n故事以一場胡編亂造的打鬥開始。戰鬥結束後，大家回到據點，故事裡的阿勒黛親自下廚，為大家煮了一鍋奶油燉菜湯。\n她在心裡輕輕笑了笑，阿勒黛真的為大家做過燉菜湯，可在回憶錄裡省略的部分是......\n口味實在說不上太好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也......你們都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想傷害你，騎士小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我必須還掉以前欠下的人情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的任務是協助這位阿勒黛小姐從諸王長眠之所帶走這把劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，幹完這一單我就能退休了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這誘惑真的很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵，我們剛剛一起哀悼了死於背叛的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為，你能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終究你與他們沒什麼不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對剛才有一瞬間想要信任你......感到恥辱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，我們剛才聊過，“活著很難”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我希望我們都能活下去，我會盡力讓我們都能活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都一樣，都是那個......被同伴推離了死亡的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但很遺憾，這次我們的路恰巧並不相同。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g10_kingrestcore"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞歷山德莉娜殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了你的安全，請把諸王之息交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是唯一的方法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我辜負了你的信任，我無話可說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以告誡我，可以斥責我，可以試圖打倒我，我全部接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我會帶著這把劍離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我在倫蒂尼姆的......“使命”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說過，諸王之息能從風暴手中守護倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也並不想把倫蒂尼姆拖入深淵，放心，這把劍不會落入薩卡茲的手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，就是大公爵們的籌碼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，你背後的人想以諸王之息的存在來威懾其他公爵加入自己的陣營。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他並不是真正想捍衛維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們，我們的力量很有限，但我們身在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與那些被損害的和被侮辱的人在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚她的目的，但這與我無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只負責做到，我只關注那些......我能把握的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼自救軍呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和克洛維希婭一起創建了它，你用自己的榮譽保護它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有榮譽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你用生命保護了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你就這麼離開，我該怎麼告訴自救軍的戰士們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克洛維希婭會處理好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒精力去在乎他們怎麼看我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，你聲稱自己只關注那些能把握的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是太輕視自己已經擁有的東西了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你知道失去它們只是早晚的問題，你還敢於擁有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當所有人信任尊敬的不過是一層偽裝，你還敢於袒露什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你發現走上的道路從一開始就只能通到此處，你還能堅持什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這甚至不是我選擇的結果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是走到了這裡，維娜。當我發現的時候，命運已經把我推到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從一開始，我們就不可能真的同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們很小的時候就見過，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在坎伯蘭的公爵府。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為你忘記了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幾乎忘了......那時，我和高文在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時，那隻太陽一般的生物告訴我，終有一日，你我會再次相逢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算是他也一定沒有料到，我們的結局會是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你不會把劍交給我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，揮動它吧。我們只能見證......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得我的承諾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了！別說了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g11_victoriaroom_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無需背負任何東西，只是你們的智囊..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...抱歉，忘記你有摩根了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就做個小混混也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起去炸薩卡茲的營地，你來點火，等煙足夠大了以後，我溜進去踹他們指揮官的屁股。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我開玩笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能在一條既定的路上走到底了，維娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼這麼說？你還和我們在一起，格拉斯哥幫還會有不少新故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會確保你踹完他們指揮官的屁股之後，還能毫髮無傷地回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的承諾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g10_kingrestcore"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是現在，那也不是玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都會回去的，毫髮無傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個聲音打破了僵持。\n是錯覺嗎？\n推進之王望向四周。巨大的石像們依舊陷在陰影中一動不動，滿地薩卡茲的屍首也沒有任何死而復生的跡象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"又一次。\n就在附近，就在她面前。\n噴氣聲的頻率逐漸加快。\n越來越響，節奏越來越清晰——直到填滿了整個地下空洞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......那是什麼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿勒黛突然一陣心悸。\n她感受到了。\n命運的預兆，如今又一次殘忍迴響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
